# --- projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb: .NET build output (scoped, not global bin/ because hexo ships a tracked bin/hexo entrypoint) ---
projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb/**/bin/
projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb/**/obj/
projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb/**/.vs/
projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb/**/TestResults/

# eShopOnWeb .vscode/launch.json gives attendees F5 debugging - track it despite the global .vscode/ ignore above
!projects/3-Brownfield/eShopOnWeb/.vscode/

# --- projects/3-Brownfield/hexo-site: generated site output, never source ---
